1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,940
Every night

2
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:05,300
at one o'clock, a small program wakes up

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:06,380
on this computer.

4
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:07,740
First,

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,920
it takes the oldest topic from the queue

6
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,000
and writes a short script.

7
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:17,640
Then a local voice engine reads the script

8
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:18,440
aloud,

9
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:22,340
and a speech model finds the exact time of

10
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:23,280
every word.

11
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:27,060
Next, an editor builds the scenes,

12
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:29,820
and the video is rendered and checked

13
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:31,240
frame by frame.

14
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:35,920
Only a video that passes every check is

15
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,740
saved and scheduled.

16
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,440
By morning,

17
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,100
the work is done.

